Notes: collaborators are Mockito mocks; every method is
tested on its real returned text, reusing the HW5
UserInterface wording and inputs. The interface has
19 methods plus 6 new HW7 methods and the FormField
record. ControllerTest setUp mocks a SessionManager
and passes it as the 6th constructor argument.
The 14 new tests above are stub tests. They pass
against the stubs in Controller.java. In week 2,
replace their expected values with the real
behaviour and keep the test names. The sendMessage
and viewMessages tests were updated for the new
Message shape.
Run: .\gradlew test --tests "control.ControllerTest" --console=plain
